                    "id": "1904101212",
                    "speaker": "Player",
                    "text": "I'm looking forward to it."
                },
                {
                    "id": "1904101215",
                    "speaker": "Player",
                    "text": "As long as you don't cause too much trouble."
                },
                {
                    "id": "1904101291",
                    "speaker": "Player",
                    "text": "How about we hang out around town?"
                },
                {
                    "id": "1904101292",
                    "speaker": "Player",
                    "text": "How about a walk in the wild?"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
